# weight-streaming ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** research into weight streaming to reduce resident memory.

**LEONES status:** P3 radar.

## Summary

Weight streaming is directly related to the objective of executing models whose full weights cannot fit in accelerator memory.

## ODS fit

The project is useful as a research reference for storage-aware execution, but it should remain outside the production runtime set until model support, performance and reliability are demonstrated.